    rdfs:label "Joy of Cats §3.1 distinguishes objects (nodes) from arrows (morphisms). The TSN identifier labels the source object TaxRow_TSN183798; iota_tsn is the arrow; Mittens is the target object. These are three distinct categorical entities." .
